# Telegram bot UX

- One clear job per message; avoid wall-of-text replies.
- Dangerous actions (sign, transfer, threshold change) require explicit confirmation steps.
- Prefer inline keyboards / buttons over ambiguous free-text commands for approvals.
- Surface errors with actionable next steps; never leak secrets in bot replies.
- Document new flows under `docs/specs/` before large implementation handoffs to Codex.
